2. DERIVATIVE WORK & MODIFICATIONS NOTICE (Apache License 2.0, Section 4)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This repository contains the unmodified upstream source code and binary of
`hp-charge-limit-rs` v0.4.1 (located in `hp-charge-limit-rs-source/` and embedded
within the standalone GUI executables), together with original graphical user
interface (GUI) wrappers and management tools developed on top of it:

- `hp-charge-limiter-gui/` (v1.0.0): Python / CustomTkinter Desktop GUI wrapper.
- `src/v2-native-wpf/`     (v2.0.0): Native Windows C# / WPF DirectX GPU-accelerated
                                     single-binary GUI with embedded Rust engine,
                                     instant Win32 volatile registry bypass, TR/EN
                                     localization, and full residue uninstaller.

No modifications were made to the core Rust ACPI/WMI hardware logic in
`hp-charge-limit-rs-source/`.
